# `python3 -m unittest discover` byte-compiles the agent next to its source.
# CPython bytecode goes stale on the next edit and conflicts on every branch
# that touches the agent, so it never belongs in a commit. The repository root
# ignores `guest/**/__pycache__/` as well; this file makes the artifacts
# unstageable no matter which lane lands first.
__pycache__/
